              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बोली (bolī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from boll, \"speak\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 9321). CDIAL glosses the Marathi word \"language\"."
